WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.910
The Qur'an says that saving one life
is like saving the whole people.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.150
For Muslims, life is a trust from God.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.250
It is held, not owned.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.180
But modern medicine brings hard cases.

5
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.460
A pregnancy.

6
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.640
A couple who cannot conceive.

7
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.650
A patient on life support.

8
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.950
If life belongs to God, can a
Muslim ever end a pregnancy,

9
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.230
use IVF, or switch off a ventilator?

10
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.630
In this mission, you'll trace
the stages of life in the womb,

11
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.270
as the Qur'an and hadith describe them.

12
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.250
Then you'll compare Sunni
and Shi'a answers on IVF.

13
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.990
Your mission: weigh up how Muslims
answer each of these three questions.
